WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.010 --> 00:00:10.090
Send your sales for the month from the portal. If your lease has turnover rent, it is worked out from them.

2
00:00:10.090 --> 00:00:13.360
Each month, report your store's sales here.

3
00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:17.990
The portal tells you which months are still to report.

4
00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:21.050
The month is chosen for you.

5
00:00:21.050 --> 00:00:24.110
Enter the gross sales, before VAT.

6
00:00:24.110 --> 00:00:28.330
Then the returns. Net sales are gross sales minus returns.

7
00:00:28.330 --> 00:00:32.080
And the number of receipts, if you have it.

8
00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:34.980
Submit sales.

9
00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:43.370
The month is listed as submitted. The leasing office checks it, and any turnover rent is invoiced from it.
